#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:100
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using &kuickshow;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:102
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Using &kuickshow; is very simple. The file browser lists files, which you "
"can select with a &LMB; click or the <keycap>Return</keycap> key."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:107
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here's a screenshot of &kuickshow;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:116
#, no-c-format
msgid "Screenshot"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:123
#, no-c-format
msgid "More &kuickshow; features"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:125
#, no-c-format
msgid "The options dialog makes available more possibilities:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:128
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Images can be automatically shrunk to fit onto the screen, if they are "
"larger."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:131
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can configure whether images should show up in their own window, or "
"always use the same window."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:134
#, no-c-format
msgid "You can set the delay time for a slide show."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:136
#, no-c-format
msgid "You can tell the browser which file types to show."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:138
#, no-c-format
msgid "You can tweak the speed/quality ratio"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:142
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you are looking for a certain file, just enter the first few characters "
"of its filename in the browser. A small edit window will pop up in the "
"bottom right corner. When a matching file is found, it is highlighted. You "
"can leave the edit window by pressing <keycap>Return</keycap> or &Esc;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:152
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guilabel>&kuickshow; Configuration</guilabel> Dialog"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:155
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>&kuickshow; Configuration</guilabel> dialog contains 5 tabs. "
"Three of them, <link linkend=\"general-options\"><guilabel>General</"
"guilabel></link>, <link linkend=\"modifications-options"
"\"><guilabel>Modifications</guilabel></link> and <link linkend=\"slideshow-"
"options\"><guilabel>Slideshow</guilabel></link> configure the operation of "
"&kuickshow;, and the other two, <link linkend=\"shortcuts-options"
"\"><guilabel>Viewer Shortcuts</guilabel></link> and <link linkend="
"\"shortcuts-options\"><guilabel>Browser Shortcuts</guilabel></link> allow "
"you to personalize the shortcuts for the respective windows."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:167
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>General</guilabel> Options"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:169
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>General</guilabel> contains the options to configure and tune "
"&kuickshow;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:174
#, no-c-format
msgid "Fullscreen mode"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:176
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this is selected, images open in full screen mode. If the image is not "
"large enough to fill the screen, the rest of the screen is filled with the "
"background color selected below. The default is off."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:184
#, no-c-format
msgid "Preload next image"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:186
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this is selected, &kuickshow; will load the next image in the folder, "
"while you are looking at the current one. This reduces the delay when you "
"select the next image, and is especially useful for slide shows."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:194
#, no-c-format
msgid "Remember last folder"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:196
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this is selected, &kuickshow; saves the name of the last folder on exit. "
"On next start &kuickshow; will open this folder in the browser window."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:202
#, no-c-format
msgid "Background color:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:204
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click on the colored bar to select a background color. This is used to fill "
"the screen in fullscreen mode, or the window, if you have resized it larger "
"than the image."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:211
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show only files with extension:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:213
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can configure &kuickshow; to only show you some of the file types it is "
"capable of."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:221
#, no-c-format
msgid "Quality/Speed"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:223
#, no-c-format
msgid "Fast rendering"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:224
#, no-c-format
msgid "Render things fast."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:229
#, no-c-format
msgid "Dither in HiColor (15/16bit) modes"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:236
#, no-c-format
msgid "Dither in LowColor (&lt;=8bit) modes"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:243
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use own color palette"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:250
#, no-c-format
msgid "Fast palette remapping"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:257
#, no-c-format
msgid "Maximum cache size (MB):"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:268
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guilabel>Modifications</guilabel> Tab"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:270
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check <guilabel>Apply default image modifications</guilabel> to open an "
"image with these modifications in &kuickshow;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:274
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scaling"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:276
#, no-c-format
msgid "Shrink image to screen size, if larger"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:278
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this is selected, large images are displayed in maximized window. The "
"default is on."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:284
#, no-c-format
msgid "Shrink image to screen size, if smaller, up to factor:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:286
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this is selected, &kuickshow; increases the magnification of small images "
"up to the selected factor."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:294
#, no-c-format
msgid "Geometry"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:296
#, no-c-format
msgid "Flip vertically"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:297
#, no-c-format
msgid "Flips the image vertically."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:302
#, no-c-format
msgid "Flip horizontally"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:303
#, no-c-format
msgid "Flips the image horizontally."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:308
#, no-c-format
msgid "Rotate image"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:309
#, no-c-format
msgid "Rotates the image to 0, 90, 180 or 270 degrees."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:317
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adjustments"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:319
#, no-c-format
msgid "Brightness:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:320
#, no-c-format
msgid "Lightens/darkens the image."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:325
#, no-c-format
msgid "Contrast:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:326
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adds/Removes contrast."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:330
#, no-c-format
msgid "Gamma:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:331
#, no-c-format
msgid "More/less gamma."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:338
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A <guilabel>Preview</guilabel> of the <guilabel>Original</guilabel> and "
"<guilabel>Modified</guilabel> image is displayed below this options."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:344
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guilabel>Slideshow</guilabel> Tab"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:349
#, no-c-format
msgid "Switch to full-screen"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:351
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Indicates if &kuickshow; should switch to full-screen mode when starting the "
"slideshow."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:357
#, no-c-format
msgid "Start with current image"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:359
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Indicates if the slideshow should start with the first image in the folder "
"or with the image which is selected."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:365
#, no-c-format
msgid "Delay between slides:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:367
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The length of time between image changes during the slideshow. You can use "
"the slider, type a new value into the field, or use the small arrows to "
"increase or decrease the value. The default is 3 seconds."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:375
#, no-c-format
msgid "Iterations (0 = infinite):"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:377
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The amount of iterations. If set to 0 it will loop until you abort the "
"slideshow. You can use the slider, type a new value into the field, or use "
"the small arrows to increase or decrease the value. The default is 1."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:388
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guimenu>Shortcuts</guimenu> Tabs"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:389
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Change the shortcuts for the different modes of &kuickshow; in the "
"<guilabel>Viewer Shortcuts</guilabel> and the <guilabel>Browser Shortcuts</"
"guilabel> tabs."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:396
#, no-c-format
msgid "Menu Reference"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:399
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guimenu>File</guimenu> Menu"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:403
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>O</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Open</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:410
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Opens a new image</action> in &kuickshow;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:414
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Show Image</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:418
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Displays </action> the selected image in a new image window."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:423
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Show Image in Active Window</"
"guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:427
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Displays </action>the selected image in the active image window."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:432
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Show Image in Fullscreen Mode</"
"guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:436
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Displays</action> the selected image in fullscreen mode."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:441
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycap>F2</keycap></shortcut> <guimenu>File</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Start Slideshow</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:446
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Starts</action> a slideshow of the images in the folder."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:450
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl; <keycap>P</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Print Image...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:456
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Prints the image</action>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:460
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\"> &Ctrl;<keycap>Q</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Quit</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:465
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Quits</action> &kuickshow;. If you have several images windows open, "
"all of them are closed."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:474
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guimenu>Edit</guimenu> Menu"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:478
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycap>F10</keycap></shortcut> <guimenu>Edit</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>New Folder...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:484
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Create</action> a new folder."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:489
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\"> <keycap>&Shift;</"
"keycap><keycap>Delete</keycap></keycombo></shortcut> <guimenu>Edit</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Delete</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:494
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Deletes</action> the current file. You will be asked to confirm the "
"action."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:499
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\"> &Alt;<keycap>Return</keycap></"
"keycombo></shortcut> <guimenu>Edit</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Properties</"
"guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:505
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Displays</action> the properties of the current image file."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:512
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guimenu>View</guimenu> Menu"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:516
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycap>F6</keycap></shortcut> <guimenu>View</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Short View</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:521
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this option is selected, only the names of the files and folders will be "
"shown."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:522
#, no-c-format
msgid "Compare this to detailed view."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:526
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycap>F7</keycap></shortcut> <guimenu>View</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Detailed View</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:531
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this option is selected, the names, sizes, dates, permissions, file "
"owners and group ownerships are shown."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:532
#, no-c-format
msgid "Compare this to short view."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:536
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycap>F8</keycap></shortcut> <guimenu>View</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Show Hidden Files</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:541
#, no-c-format
msgid "This will toggle between revealing and hiding normally hidden files."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:545
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycap>F12</keycap></shortcut> <guimenu>View</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Separate Folders</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:550
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use this option to toggle between a 2 pane view of the file system (one pane "
"for the folders and one pane for the files) and a one pane view of the file "
"system with folders and files."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:555
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>View</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Large Icons</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:559
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Display the image files in the folder with large icons. This item is only "
"available in <guimenuitem>Short View</guimenuitem> mode."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:564
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>View</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Small Icons</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:568
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Display the image files in the folder with small icons. This item is only "
"available in <guimenuitem>Short View</guimenuitem> mode."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:573
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>View</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Thumbnail Previews</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:577
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Display a preview of the images in the folder. This item is only available "
"in <guimenuitem>Short View</guimenuitem> mode."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:581
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\"> &Ctrl;<keycap>-</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>View</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Zoom Out</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:586
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Reduces the image size by ten percent</action>. Again this refers to "
"the <emphasis>current</emphasis> size of the image."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:592
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\"> &Ctrl;<keycap>+</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>View</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Zoom In</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:597
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Enlarges the image by ten percent</action>. Notice that this refers "
"to the <emphasis>current</emphasis> size of the picture."
msgstr ""

